+| `1,2,3,4` | `rat(1024,1024) = 1` | `1` |
+| singleton `5` | `rat(0,1)` | `0` |
+| `-2,0,2` | `rat(108,81) = 4/3` | `4/3` |
+| `1/10,2/10,3/10` | a non-normalized `rat` equal to `1/15` | `1/15` |
